{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309550","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309550","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1130955001:1":{"text":"お、俺は生まれ故郷に帰るんだ。","source_cn":"我、我要回到我出生的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C4F93DA9D0DA06E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130955002:1":{"text":"ここは危険すぎる！鹹水町も周辺の集落も……絶対に俺を受け入れてくれない。","source_cn":"这里太危险了！咸水镇的人……还有周围的部落，都绝对不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9F79EA588B1FD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130955003:1":{"text":"俺は、サンドクローに騙されたんだ！もしかしたら、家族も俺のことを探してるかもしれない！","source_cn":"而且，我是被骗进流沙之爪的！说不定，我的家人还一直在找我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26BC6C6A2123163B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130955004:1":{"text":"でも帰る前に、まずはこの服を着替えないとな……","source_cn":"不过，在回去之前，我得先把这身衣服换掉才行……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE44F7BACD43300F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:流沙之爪提克斯":{"text":"ティークス","source":"流沙之爪提克斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}